Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:10.66,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}それでも闘って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:13.24,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}涙を失って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:18.51,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}全て間違いだとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:21.52,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}今を変えれるのは
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.05,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}自分自身だけなんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:30.97,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}超えていけ 憧れたヒーロー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:08.94,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}無論路途多麼遙遠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:13.98,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}也曾有勇氣邁出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:17.20,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}無論無數次碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:20.00,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}不管跌倒多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:24.95,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}心中堅信一定能抵達
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:40.97,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}始終追尋著那日所見的風景
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:45.98,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}可只是一味追趕 卻怎麼也追不上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:49.18,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕挑戰數千回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:51.89,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕失敗數萬次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:56.69,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}幾乎要放棄一切時
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:02:00.50,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}那無法言喻的心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:03.16,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}卻在吶喊「還能繼續努力」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:07.45,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}於是再次堅定地許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:10.66,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}即便如此 也要繼續戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:13.24,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕淚水不再
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:18.51,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}即使一切都是錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:21.52,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}能改變此刻的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.05,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}唯有自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:30.97,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}去超越吧 那曾憧憬的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:59.07,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}遥かその先へ 止まることなく
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:04.10,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}さぁ突き進め 今がその時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.03,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.91,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}思えばこんなにも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:19.95,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}遠くまで来たもんだな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.95,0:22:22.01,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}身の丈の歩幅で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:25.13,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}日々道々 未だ進行形さ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:29.34,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}容赦のない時の風に惑う独り
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:34.14,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}ゆっくりと重なりゆく人の影が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:36.47,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}ひとつ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:37.12,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}(you're the best part of my life)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:38.89,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}ふたつ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.65,0:22:39.73,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}(you're the best part of my life)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:41.34,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}みっつ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.15,0:22:42.24,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}(you're the best part of my life)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:44.53,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}揺れる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.65,0:22:44.65,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}(you're the best part of my life)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:49.14,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}守りたい笑顔があるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:54.16,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}忍ばせた想いが奮い立たせる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.82,0:22:59.03,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}陽は昇りまた新しい朝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.13,0:23:04.08,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}注ぐ光は道なき方へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:09.09,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}さぁ突き進め 今がその時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:11.00,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:59.07,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}步履不停地奔赴那盡顯遙遠的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:04.10,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}當下就是奮勇前行的最佳時機
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.91,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}回想起來之後發現
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:19.95,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}我們竟然走了如此之遠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.95,0:22:22.01,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}按照自己的步伐
